@startuml
title MiniDB Benchmark - Sequenza di Esecuzione

skinparam shadowing false

actor Operatore
participant "BenchmarkRunner" as Runner
participant "Options.parse" as Options
participant "Workload directory" as WorkloadDir
participant "Build Java" as BuildJava
participant "Build Rust" as BuildRust
participant "Implementazione MiniDB" as Impl
database "benchmark/results" as Results

Operatore -> Runner : avvia benchmark con opzioni CLI
Runner -> Options : parse(args)
Options --> Runner : runs, workload, mode

Runner -> WorkloadDir : crea cartella workload
Runner -> Results : crea cartella risultati

alt generazione workload abilitata
  Runner -> WorkloadDir : genera file mancanti o vuoti
end

Runner -> BuildJava : compila java-minidb
BuildJava --> Runner : classi aggiornate
Runner -> BuildRust : compila rust-minidb
BuildRust --> Runner : binario aggiornato

Runner -> WorkloadDir : carica workload selezionati
WorkloadDir --> Runner : lista comandi

loop per ogni workload, implementazione e run
  Runner -> Impl : avvia processo
  Runner -> Impl : invia comandi su stdin
  Impl --> Runner : risposte su stdout

  alt modalita throughput
    Runner -> Runner : misura tempo e latenze
  else modalita memory
    Runner -> Runner : campiona RSS iniziale e picco
  end

  Runner -> Impl : termina processo
end

Runner -> Results : scrive risultati CSV
Runner -> Results : scrive riepiloghi aggregati
Runner --> Operatore : stampa sintesi

note right of Runner
Le implementazioni vengono confrontate
usando gli stessi workload e lo stesso
protocollo testuale.
end note

@enduml
